        <li><strong>Discretion:</strong> Virtually unnoticeable to others in meetings, cafes, or public</li>
        <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Minimal tin space, more pouches per can</li>
        <li><strong>Faster release:</strong> Quicker nicotine absorption — oral mucosa absorption is pH-dependent (optimal at pH 6.5–7.5); slim format maintains compatible pH through modified composition (<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/27351043/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hiemstra et al. (2016)</a>)</li>
        <li><strong>Cost efficiency:</strong> More pouches per batch, driving prices down</li>
    </ul>

